; ── Status — exists but starts BLANK + auto-hides ───────────────────
; main.gd sets a transient hint on first room entry; iter-119's
; _process_status_fade now drives it all the way to alpha 0.0 (gone)
; after HINT_FADE_DELAY, instead of staying at 0.30 dim-but-visible.
