; ── RIGHT — wave only. KillsLabel hidden during gameplay (it lives on
; for the death screen which reads _kills directly from main.gd).
;
; Iter-124 game-design pass: genre peers (Hades / Dead Cells / Hyper
; Light Drifter / Diablo / Enter the Gungeon) all surface run-score
; data at the END of a run, not during combat. Live kills counter is
; meta-score, not gameplay-critical; surfacing it during play just adds
; visual noise. Hidden via `visible = false` so the node + the
; _update_kills code keeps working (writes still go through; just the
; screen never shows them).
